{
    "_comment": "\u00a712.5-A pano DFoT mask-only inference. Adapted from ctsd_35_df16_6views_video_generation_with_layout.json. Key changes: 2-pano (view_count=2) instead of 6-cam, 256x2304 per-half resolution, PanoNuScenesDataset, sequence_length=5, inference_steps=25 (divisible by seq_len). Set inference_config.temporal_attention_mask='causal' for masked variant; null for unmasked baseline.",
